"{\"blocks\":[{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"I’d check the January 2 United award first if that date works for you: it has a lower reported USD award-tax quote than the January 1 Alaska award. That is only a comparison of the quoted amounts, not proof of lower total trip cost, because both quote scopes are unknown. Neither result is a complete itinerary, so confirm the award details before relying on either.\"},{\"k\":\"l\",\"r\":\"A5@2027-01-02/SFO>BKK/E\",\"n\":\"United award lead · January 2\",\"v\":\"The result reports 55,000 United miles, economy, and 9 seats for SFO–BKK, with a USD 24.50 award-tax quote whose scope is unknown. It lists BR, ET, SQ, UA, and ZH as carriers, but provides only the date—not a schedule or full routing. The reported seat count is not confirmation that an award is available for your one traveler; the returned traveler count is absent. Confirm the itinerary, award availability, and fee scope.\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"If January 1 is preferable, the Alaska lead is another date-specific check. Its reported points are in a different program, so they are not directly comparable with United’s miles. Its USD quote is higher as a raw reported amount, but that does not establish a like-for-like cost difference.\"},{\"k\":\"l\",\"r\":\"A3@2027-01-01/SFO>BKK/E\",\"n\":\"Alaska award lead · January 1\",\"v\":\"The result reports 42,500 Alaska miles, economy, and 8 seats for SFO–BKK, with a USD 50.90 award-tax quote whose scope is unknown. It lists AS and JX as carriers, but provides only the date—not a schedule or full routing. The reported seat count is not confirmation that an award is available for your one traveler; the returned traveler count is absent. Confirm the itinerary, award availability, and fee scope.\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"As a cash reference, the search also returned the following one-stop itinerary. Its fare quote is not established as a per-traveler or party total, so it cannot be treated as an all-in comparison with either award lead.\"},{\"k\":\"b\",\"r\":\"C1@2027-01-01T22:55-08:00/SFO>BKK\",\"n\":\"Cash baseline · January 1\",\"v\":\"Cathay Pacific, one stop via HKG; departure from SFO at 10:55 p.m. January 1 and arrival in BKK at 10:35 a.m. January 4 local time. The source quote is USD 640.00, with unknown scope. The record reports one returned traveler, but that does not establish the quote’s scope.\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"These are selected search results, not a complete inventory. The search was partial, and neither award result includes leg-by-leg cabin details. Check current availability, schedules, and prices with the booking provider before making plans.\"}]}"
